"note": "a swaggering big-guy walk with a short rusty hatchet (the knight: a round shield on one arm); it dies on the Falling Back Death clip; the standard dark outline. Pass 131: the back walk painted again on the driver bigguy_shield (tools/pose_hang.py arms=l: seen from behind the shield arm hangs with the shield as the painting holds it, where the walk folded it up in front of the chest and left the shield in the air without it); only the 12 back frames changed, the old strip is in tools/dl/p131/SKEL/before/. Pass 132c: this is pass 131's strip, icon and provenance byte for byte (pass 132 had committed Garry's re-rolls and pass 132b restored those by mistake; his last re-roll is in tools/dl/p132/KND/before/garry_reroll2/, pass 132b's file in tools/dl/p132/KND2/before/); only the death is new: `pitch` (artkit.pitch_fall on this strip's own idle frame, then the face-down still painted in pass 132b: the back of the helmet and the back plate to the viewer, the shield on its arm; 8 frames) Pass 132d: the death is a painted fall (a first-last-frame clip from the standing painting to the face-down still, death \"clip\" with death_motion and death_pick; the pitch warp read as a squash).",
